{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16207583","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16207583","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1620758301:0":{"text":"저기, 몸은 괜찮아? 사랑의 묘약 효과가 아직 남아있는 것 같지는 않고?","source_cn":"怎么样，你身体还好吗？有感觉到爱情魔药的残留吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC9AB3B7DAE691BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1620758302:0":{"text":"방금 마신 게 사랑의 묘약이었다고? 세상에... 뭐, 뭔가 잘못된 것 같은데...","source_cn":"我刚刚喝下的是爱情魔药？糟了……我、我做错事了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x212A77441C5F8F67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620758303:1":{"text":"잘못? ","source_cn":"做错事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4478CA9D215E843","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620758304:1":{"text":"“서프라이즈”를 주겠다며 레이나에게 공개적으로 고백을 여러 번 했었거든. 그런데 걘 한 번도 받아주지 않았어...","source_cn":"我以前为了制造“惊喜”，曾冒昧地向蕾娜公开表白过好几次...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x091A126ADCD46EAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620758305:1":{"text":"방금 깨달았어. 진정한 사랑은 일방적인 게 아니라, 서로 공명해야 하는 거였어. 그런데 나는 레이나와 아직 충분히 친해지지도 않았는데 성급하게 공개적으로 고백을 해서 큰 부담을 준 거였잖아...","source_cn":"刚才我突然明白过来，真正的爱情不是一厢情愿，而是双方的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1768182ACEC3FAE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620758306:1":{"text":"지금 당장 레이나에게 사과하러 갈게. 걱정해 줘서 고마워!","source_cn":"我决定了，我现在就去向蕾娜道歉！谢谢你们的关心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC75EA8CD10FCEF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620758307:1":{"text":"아... 사랑의 묘약에 이런 효과가 있을 줄은 몰랐네.","source_cn":"欸……没想到爱情魔药还有这样的功效啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADB0C387323AE08A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:皮帕":{"text":"피파","source":"皮帕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:西瑞尔":{"text":"시릴","source":"西瑞尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}